window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The ice maiden is dead.</b></p> <p>When a young woman is found dead—shot through the heart with an arrow—it's up to DI Tom Brand and DS Kate Ryan to solve her bizarre murder.</p> <p>The residents of Relby village, still recovering from recent tragic events, are up in arms that the icy finger of Death has touched the community once again.</p> <p>With the press hounding them for information, and a DSI expecting a quick solution to the mystery, Brand and Ryan are working against the clock to make sure the killer doesn't strike again.</p> <p><b><i>Bury the Maiden</i></b><b> is the thrilling new novel from the bestselling author of the Murder Force series.</b></p>"; 
